    After discussion on IRC it was deemed that having Lojgugde in space was=
 a much cooler idea, and solved some problems of an Earth-bound show.  The =
pilot episode plot outline's been rewritten (see https://docs.google.com/do=
cument/edit?id=3D1Figgelppx0xep5HC7GRConr445BHq3Oycb6uAB8tL2Y&hl=3Den_GB fo=
r current version, it's a much quicker read than you might expect).  I've g=
ot as far as getting the characters into space but where and what they're h=
eading to is still being decided.  FWIW the show is probably going to lean =
more on sci than pure fi.

kozmikreis



